# {{ machine_class_name(model) }}

Use this directory as a self-contained Python 3.7+ runtime. Put your application in `app.py`; keep generated `machine.py` unchanged and regenerate it when the DSL changes. No installed `pyfcstm` package is needed to run it.

**Generated files:** `machine.py` contains the runtime; `README.md` and `README_zh.md` are the English and Chinese guides. Start below, then follow [Inputs and actions](#integration) and [Initialization and recovery](#initialization).

